Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.20,0:01:44.54,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Those who fight with a heart pierced by the arrow
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.54,0:01:48.04,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}butsukeau kokoro wa utsukushii
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.54,0:01:48.04,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Are a beautiful sight to behold
