Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.82,0:02:22.28,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(139,890)\fs60}Episode 16: {\fs80} Let's Go Hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were just regular cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping a nimble rat within\Nrange won't be so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why we have these bearings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll expand your range to 20 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're useless against stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use them when you're in\Nposition to take down the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to use them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even have the concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for ball sports and stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad for a newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd give it an 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I need you to remember\None thing while on this hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When dealing with live animals, you\Nhave to prioritize composure over speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you corner the rat\Nand screw up the shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't expect it to be gullible\Nenough to come within range again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hold your fire until you\Nknow you can hit your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more thing, don't let\Nthe pressure bog you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he sure knows how to\Nmake a guy feel at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what he told me, Otoishi shot\Nthe rat near this irrigation canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the location, it\Nwas probably a brown rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brown rats are agile swimmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adaptable and can eat\Npractically anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Larger rats can grow up to\N20 or 30 centimeters long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.62,0:04:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And some can weigh as much as one kilogram
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a horizontal leap\Nof about two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found them. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those aren't bird tracks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its four feet have four\Ndigits and its hind feet five.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The S shape means it's dragging something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These markings are tail tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat's about 20 centimeters long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many, but\Nthere are more than one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a tick on this leaf, which means\Nit's a stomping ground for rodents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in that drain is a nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, our best bet is to set a trap\Nand see what the video camera picks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of those cameras that lets\Nyou watch while you're recording, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to use\Ncheese for the trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hunk of tempura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheese is too luxurious for a common rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:04:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are dead rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks like a block of jellyfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you poking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At some point, the flesh of these\Nrats melted and later congealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems as though the melting\Nstarted from under their flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world does something as\Nmessed up as that even happen? Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess, I'd say this is\Nthe handiwork of the rat we're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it stand at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That seems to be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took out its fellow rats to seize\Nthe territory, which would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's highly likely the rat's\Nmaking a nest in that drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question now is, has our culprit\Nused its powers to wreak any more havoc?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the drainage canal\Ncontinues on to that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might already be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it beat us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first glance, I see a\Nchicken coop, but no chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cars are still parked in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there doesn't appear to\Nbe any activity in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The front door is unlocked and open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All signs point to the rat being inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to assume the owners of\Nthis house have already been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat will let us approach\Nit up to a certain point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's intelligent enough to know that most\Nhumans are too slow to ever catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's not expecting to\Nbe used as target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how we'll close in and put\Nan end to this mess with one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are rat droppings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no grass or grain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The droppings lead to\Nthat room. Come on. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like an old\Nrefrigerator compressor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I going crazy or did the\Nrefrigerator just open by itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the door's magnet\Ngive out or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little bastard's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what opened the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me rats could\Nopen refrigerator doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must have\Nforgotten to shut it. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get real, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not that gullible, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rat's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:07:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro went into the next\Nroom to look for the rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaking great. Now our eyes have met
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell the rat did this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still alive. Did\Nthe rat disfigure the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,owners of this house with\Nits stand so it have An
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,easier time storing them\Nin the fridge oh and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's eating them! Damn it!\NJotaro's not coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to kill this thing myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When dealing with live animals, you\Nhave to focus on composure over speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't tag him on my first\Ntry, he'll know my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you said no pressure, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, the table and chair are\Npositioned just enough to be in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure I sink this ball\Nbearing right between his beady little eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I move closer, he'll run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blast him from over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's moving! Now!
