Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, it wasn't a fatal blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weird machine must be a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, pal, come and get some if you\Nthink you've got what it takes to beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just know that my next shot is\Ngonna take you out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he's running under the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat's in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shape...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand fires projectiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I slap it away with my bare hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hit it with my ball\Nbearing or did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't between his eyes like\NI said, but he's still a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took out the rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hunt is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what were you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went missing right\Nwhen I needed you the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think\Nyou'd abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, at least it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, everything\Nwent according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for me, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our rat friend wasn't so fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though his stand shot some\Nneedle-like things at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever they were, I bet they're\Nwhat turned your flesh to goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got to the people who own this\Nplace, but they're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix them right up\Nwith Shining Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't eliminate them by sundown,\Nthings might get even messier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was another rat, and\Nthat one managed to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, your hand is melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have dodged the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought catching the needle\Nfor analysis was the best choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it takes is a touch\Nand it stand poison
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,begins to permeate even\Nmelting other stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five or six hits and you'll turn\Ninto a quivering mass of flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh good thing that needle didn't hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd be\Ngrateful for being squeamish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat bolted out the door\Nafter hitting me with the needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow it must have figured out you\Nkilled its kin here in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um sorry to bother but would you\Nmind using your power to fix my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why those little SOBs have to multiply?
