Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Speedwagon\NFoundation Research Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've tried to reach you several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hunting the rat\Nand had the ringer off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this about Otoishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akira Otoishi was withholding the fact\Nthat he shot two rats instead of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any chance he could\Nhave shot three or four?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sure it's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief, Otoishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to its own territory, it'll\Nkill everything, humans and rats alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cares only about itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this savage's time on Earth is\Nabout to come to a fast end. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, hold on a minute, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pint-sized rodent just\Nran into an open field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly do you plan on\Ntracking this thing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A famous artist, Ernest\NThompson Seton, once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not an animal on the\Nplanet that cannot be tracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to know their habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rats are known to avoid unfamiliar paths,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means its root of escape had to\Nbe that irrigation channel from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's something else about rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're not constantly eating,\Nthey'll starve within a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are fresh bite marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an awesome start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're gonna corner\Nthat bucktooth bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this. I\Ndon't think he even gave
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a damn that our bait\Nwas here he's on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:14:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh his ear looks like a bug-eaten leaf\Nwhat do you say we call him bug-eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being cautious. This isn't gonna be\Nlike at the house Bug-Eaten is gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,extra careful to not let a skip within 20
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meters of them be\Nbecause of air resistance
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ball bearings lose accuracy when traveling\Nover 20 meters with a bullet nose like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this we'll be able to\Nhit our mark up to 70
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meters away will I have\Nto launch that with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand's hand too because I don't think\NI'm ready for that just yet. Point taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to be the one to do it. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right there just what\Nare you trying to say
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That comment didn't sit well with me. I am
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one who nailed the\Nrat back at the house
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember sure it wasn't exactly a perfect\Nshot but still guess you're right take two
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This puddle is full of leeches. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful. Eyes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The footprints suddenly stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they randomly stop like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's under us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have burrowed a\Nhole and covered himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:15:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is called backtracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know rats could do this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backtracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backtracking is the way\Nin which a wild animal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reverses itself by\Nstepping in its own tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This confuses predators long\Nenough for them to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Japan, the behavior has been observed\Nwith brown bears, weasels, and rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it is unheard of\Namong rats and other rodents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that a common brown\Nrat pulled a fast one on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have taken a turn for the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this kind of terrain\Nthe hunters may have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just become the prey I\Nhave this Creepy feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're being watched we\Nbetter duck behind a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rock while we Still have\Nthe chance no sudden
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Movements. The good news\Nis bug Eaton's Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't too fast for us to see just keep an
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eye out for the point\Nof fire if We can figure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out where he's hiding\Nwe'll snipe him instead
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dirty rodent used our\Nown rat trap against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I removed the needle\Nbefore the poison spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Along with all the affected tissue,\Nyou should put a bandage on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was also able to locate\Nhis general whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's halfway up the hill,\Nnear those three rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found him and helped me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who's more amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared with the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel like I'm\Na kid at the grown-up's table.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 60 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, no sign of any more needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows a random firing\Nwould give away his location,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's obvious he doesn't\Nwant to be attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a stubborn bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you praising that damn rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to act, and we have to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well spoken, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to give this assault everything\Nwe've got, or Bug-Eaten will kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll give you all four rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this distance, the rounds\Nwill rise like sliders,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so aim one centimeter below the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm firing, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm moving in so he'll shoot his needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job, Josuke, is to\Ndetermine his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, I'm counting on you to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have a choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if one or two of his needles get me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can just use Shining\NDiamond to heal me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't heal yourself with that\Npower, so you get the kill shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our last stand. Make it count.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could i have a second to\Nprepare star platinum the world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you find him no No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as he fired, he ran\Noff and hit somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try getting closer while\Ngoing up the side of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for him to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn this pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:19:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! I see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little shithel\Npredicted I'd dodge his
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack and fired the needles\Nat the rocks instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ricocheted at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stand there gawking at me, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes trained on the rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment he attacks, blow\Nhis ass straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got four rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm out of chances if I\Nwaste even a single second here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We go just a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he's in the same spot\Nas the last time he fired,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's hiding behind the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only he was looking over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.16,0:20:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to hit a tiny target.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suddenly feel that fighting spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right then, it's time for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shosuke missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are. I knew\Nmy miss would make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turn around it's good\Nto see that ugly face
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and right now you're\Nright in my crosshairs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I can hang with the grown-ups\Nafter all. Call me Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:22:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mighty vanquisher of pressure\Nand stress, Akira's mutant stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rats got me thinking they are\Nreflections of our destruction of the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,environment i'm not sure how to feel\Nbut at least josuke is a dependable guy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good grief maybe now we'll\Nall get a little peace of mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any time I need to see your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it has closed my eyes And I am\Ntaking two bits with a crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mine A magenta feeling Take\Na chapter in the face of my
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spine Straight like a Chaka\Ncherry cola I don't need to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,try to explain I just hold on\Ntight And if it happens again
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.93,0:22:53.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.31,0:22:55.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'ma move so slightly To the\Narms and the lips and the
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.56,0:22:58.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.30,0:22:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,face Of the humane kind of all\Nthat I need to I want to Come
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.35,0:23:00.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and stand a little bit closer\NBreathe in and get a bit
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.40,0:23:04.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.10,0:23:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higher. You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you. Oh,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.77,0:23:07.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.57,0:23:09.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you. I don't know\Nif I need you. But ooh,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.28,0:23:11.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.53,0:23:13.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.87,0:23:15.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.49,0:23:18.12,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.12,0:23:22.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.44,0:23:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ooh, I got to find you.
